
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Midterm Introduction</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dbeafe, #e9d5ff);
            color: #1e293b;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            background: white;
            max-width: 650px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px #00000015;
        }

        .profile {
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border: 4px solid #c4b5fd;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #6d28d9;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #7c3aed;
            margin: 25px 0 10px;
        }

        p {
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #ede9fe;
            color: #6d28d9;
            padding: 8px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            margin: 5px;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #64748b;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <main class="container">

        <!-- Replace this with your photo filename -->
        <img src="profile.jpg" alt="My Profile Photo"
             class="profile">

        <h1>Hello, I'm Your Name!</h1>
        <p>Welcome to my Midterm Introduction Website.</p>

        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>
            Hi! I'm a student who enjoys learning new things,
            exploring my interests, and developing new skills.
            This website is a short introduction about myself,
            my goals, and my aspirations.
        </p>

        <h2>My Interests</h2>
        <span class="tag">Learning</span>
        <span class="tag">Creativity</span>
        <span class="tag">Technology</span>

        <h2>My Goals</h2>
        <p>
            My goal is to continue improving myself, gain new
            knowledge, and use what I learn to create meaningful
            opportunities for my future.
        </p>

        <footer>
            © 2026 My Midterm Introduction | Made with HTML & CSS
        </footer>

    </main>
</body>
</html>
